WEBVTT

00:01.450 --> 00:03.090
<i>The gate to the underworld is ope—</i>

00:03.730 --> 00:04.470
Not good!

00:04.470 --> 00:05.980
<i>We have to eliminate Morris!</i>

00:19.090 --> 00:20.940
<i>Felis Characteristic: Agility.</i>

00:21.260 --> 00:22.660
<i>Those two...</i>

00:23.280 --> 00:25.310
<i>They're devils of the highest order!</i>

00:32.170 --> 00:34.550
<i>Plumede is shaking.</i>

00:34.810 --> 00:36.720
<i>The first layer of the underworld,</i>

00:36.720 --> 00:39.330
<i>and we're dealing with two 
devils of the highest order.</i>

00:39.770 --> 00:42.810
<i>I'd assumed their strength would 
rival that of the Dark Triad, but...</i>

00:47.560 --> 00:50.650
Why don't we go a little harder?

00:51.880 --> 00:53.660
Yes, let's.

00:54.300 --> 00:55.070
Wha—

01:23.000 --> 01:25.420
<i>They're on another level!</i>

01:25.420 --> 01:28.330
Isn't this mana delicious, Lilith?

01:28.330 --> 01:30.230
It is, Naamah.

01:30.620 --> 01:32.300
<i>They're just playing!</i>

01:40.440 --> 01:41.740
Those roots...

01:42.230 --> 01:46.620
They're absorbing the mana 
out of the atmosphere?

01:50.990 --> 01:55.450
What is this mass of ominous mana?

02:05.430 --> 02:07.610
They're... devils?!

02:10.190 --> 02:11.440
Oho?

02:11.900 --> 02:14.230
That's similar to the mana from back then.

02:25.620 --> 02:26.970
I see...

02:28.750 --> 02:31.090
So our game has only just begun!

02:38.670 --> 02:43.140
<i>I couldn't defeat him at 80% power.</i>

02:43.140 --> 02:45.060
This is the end, Zenon!

02:45.680 --> 02:46.560
<i>But...</i>

02:46.880 --> 02:48.530
How unfortunate for you.

02:50.440 --> 02:51.800
This is...

02:51.800 --> 02:55.990
I sealed away her curse power, 
but her mana is overflowing...

02:58.620 --> 03:00.380
The first gate...

03:01.370 --> 03:04.750
was the barrier that made our contracts 
with the devils incomplete.

03:05.140 --> 03:08.320
But now... it's open!

03:09.240 --> 03:12.880
<i>Devil power at 100%!</i>

03:26.380 --> 03:29.530
Now, let us continue, shall we?

04:55.540 --> 05:00.900
<b><i>Black Guardian</i></b>

05:05.940 --> 05:08.700
I'm sorry to bother you 
while you're resting...

05:09.480 --> 05:13.040
But I'd like you to play 
with me a bit more!

05:26.090 --> 05:28.810
Well, that was just mean!

05:28.810 --> 05:32.340
Even though I love you <i>this</i> much!

05:32.770 --> 05:35.790
Come on! Let's go together!

05:45.160 --> 05:49.370
<i>His bone regeneration and attack 
power went up even more?!</i>

05:49.370 --> 05:52.510
<i>All of the damage to his 
body is already healed!</i>

05:52.920 --> 05:57.660
Your victory... was nothing 
more than a fleeting dream.

06:00.770 --> 06:03.590
<i>Damn it! They're coming from everywhere!</i>

06:04.230 --> 06:08.010
<i>Leaving Morris unchecked is 
making this situation worse!</i>

06:08.470 --> 06:11.690
<i>I have to get away from here 
immediately and eliminate him!</i>

06:12.620 --> 06:16.680
<i>But who knows what these devils 
of the highest order might do?</i>

06:16.680 --> 06:19.350
<i>Someone has to keep them busy, too.</i>

06:19.930 --> 06:22.980
<i>Defeating Morris and keeping 
these devils in check...</i>

06:23.290 --> 06:25.730
<i>The best move for us to actually win is...</i>

06:28.640 --> 06:29.800
Plumede.

06:31.330 --> 06:32.960
Die with me.

06:34.330 --> 06:37.580
You are going to be the ones who'll die.

06:38.190 --> 06:39.930
But don't worry.

06:40.400 --> 06:43.340
Because you all have 
no place to return to.

06:43.340 --> 06:44.410
What?!

06:50.270 --> 06:52.260
Hey, over there...

07:13.850 --> 07:16.460
It's the demon!

07:18.570 --> 07:20.800
<i>The demon is a miracle created</i>

07:20.800 --> 07:24.170
<i>from people's hatred and the 
power from the underworld.</i>

07:24.650 --> 07:25.990
<i>Once upon a time,</i>

07:25.990 --> 07:32.140
<i>there were two royal young men 
who had incredible magic powers.</i>

07:32.140 --> 07:34.160
<i>They were the best of friends.</i>

07:34.770 --> 07:37.880
<i>But gradually, they 
grew to hate each other.</i>

07:37.880 --> 07:44.090
<i>They both became demons, fought, 
and were eventually sealed away.</i>

07:44.860 --> 07:49.770
We've awakened the two ancient demons 
that the Grinberryalls were guarding.

07:50.090 --> 07:53.700
We released them to distract you...

07:53.700 --> 07:57.950
But with this many mages here...

07:57.950 --> 08:01.580
Do you really think your home will last?

08:04.500 --> 08:06.460
<i>It's absorbing mana through its wings...</i>

08:10.690 --> 08:13.100
<i>And now its mana is even greater!</i>

08:19.220 --> 08:22.010
<i>I won't stand a chance 
against them in this body.</i>

08:22.810 --> 08:25.290
<i>I need time to release my full power.</i>

08:25.730 --> 08:28.060
<i>Please hold on until then, everyone!</i>

08:29.050 --> 08:32.280
I'm sorry, but I need your power.

08:32.840 --> 08:34.100
I'm counting on you.

08:39.920 --> 08:41.410
R-Run away!

08:41.630 --> 08:44.720
It's too big! There's nothing we can do!

08:48.400 --> 08:51.580
Vortex Magic: Area Helix!

08:56.730 --> 08:59.350
Don't let it take another step!

08:59.350 --> 09:03.310
While Captain Kaiser and the Purple 
Orcas are killing that thing's momentum,

09:03.310 --> 09:05.810
we need to get everyone to safety!

09:12.610 --> 09:14.030
<i>Cherry Blossom Magic...</i>

09:14.030 --> 09:14.890
<i>Mist Magic...</i>

09:14.890 --> 09:16.960
<i>Magic Cherry Blossom Storm of Petals.</i>

09:16.960 --> 09:17.740
<i>Transient Illusion.</i>

09:22.510 --> 09:23.410
Solid!

09:24.920 --> 09:28.670
<i>Water Creation Magic: 
Sea Serpent's Bellow!</i>

09:34.170 --> 09:38.140
Damn it! I spent six months 
training my magic...

09:38.490 --> 09:41.050
And all I could do was divert the attack!

09:50.800 --> 09:52.190
<i>Its magic...</i>

09:52.190 --> 09:54.190
<i>...is just too powerful!</i>

09:54.190 --> 09:57.200
Yet it's not beautiful.

10:07.370 --> 10:10.920
<i>Scale Magic: Scale Regulate!</i>

10:13.610 --> 10:16.010
<i>Its mana is far too massive.</i>

10:16.010 --> 10:18.930
<i>The only way to fight such 
tremendous magic is</i>

10:19.170 --> 10:21.970
<i>to strike back with equally 
tremendous magic.</i>

10:24.920 --> 10:26.270
That magic...

10:27.130 --> 10:29.080
Th-That's...

10:34.690 --> 10:36.050
The Wizard King!

10:36.050 --> 10:37.530
That's the Wizard King!

10:38.020 --> 10:41.110
<i>I advanced my body's time ten years.</i>

10:41.620 --> 10:44.030
<i>There are limits to both 
time and my abilities...</i>

10:44.550 --> 10:46.830
<i>But if I combine my 
power with Damnatio's...</i>

10:49.290 --> 10:50.250
Now!

10:59.030 --> 11:01.750
<i>Give me strength once more!</i>

11:05.150 --> 11:06.310
<i>It's already time?!</i>

11:06.670 --> 11:08.850
<i>But why?! That's way too fast!</i>

11:08.850 --> 11:09.900
What?

11:09.900 --> 11:11.770
The Wizard King?

11:13.090 --> 11:15.910
<i>I can't... hold it any longer.</i>

11:32.990 --> 11:37.200
In this world, magic is everything.

11:37.790 --> 11:39.210
It's all over.

11:44.970 --> 11:46.720
Too bad for you.

11:47.070 --> 11:49.950
He's still in the Clover Kingdom!

12:06.310 --> 12:07.740
Asta!

12:14.270 --> 12:15.710
Let's do this, Liebe!

12:15.710 --> 12:16.960
Yeah!

12:16.960 --> 12:18.340
Devil Union!

12:23.380 --> 12:24.810
Let's do this, Liebe!

12:24.810 --> 12:25.760
Yeah!

12:25.760 --> 12:27.150
Devil Union!

12:37.840 --> 12:38.670
Huh?

12:39.020 --> 12:42.860
<i>He just... erased all of that magic?</i>

12:55.620 --> 12:59.130
<i>Right now, our Devil Union 
only lasts five minutes.</i>

12:59.130 --> 13:02.090
<i>We'll take that thing down instantly!</i>

13:04.590 --> 13:06.170
Magic Parliament Guy.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.040
Watch me.

13:08.570 --> 13:09.470
I'm...

13:10.440 --> 13:13.770
gonna protect this 
kingdom with this devil!

13:14.980 --> 13:17.480
Is that... a devil?!

13:17.480 --> 13:18.740
It's a devil!

13:21.520 --> 13:25.990
A devil and demon have come 
to destroy this kingdom!

13:25.990 --> 13:27.030
You're wrong!

13:27.610 --> 13:30.870
It's Asta... That's Asta!

13:31.270 --> 13:34.320
Asta's protecting this kingdom!

13:35.590 --> 13:37.120
Damn it... Damn it!

13:37.120 --> 13:39.000
Curse that peasant!

13:39.350 --> 13:43.060
It's horrible and absolutely 
not my taste...

13:43.560 --> 13:46.260
But this may also be beauty!

13:46.550 --> 13:52.140
To think that shrimp's able 
to do something this crazy...

13:52.810 --> 13:54.260
You can do this.

13:55.210 --> 13:57.640
And it's not because you're 
possessed by a devil...

13:58.170 --> 14:01.480
It's because you're more of a 
Magic Knight than anyone else!

14:01.960 --> 14:05.530
Go! Asta!

14:47.030 --> 14:50.030
<i>The ancient demon is a giant 
mass of supercharged magic!</i>

14:50.380 --> 14:52.430
<i>It repels all spells in existence</i>

14:52.430 --> 14:57.650
<i>and uses primitive, repetitive attacks 
to crush and mow down everything!</i>

14:58.190 --> 15:02.130
<i>But that's exactly why it can't 
block any anti-magic attacks!</i>

15:39.590 --> 15:41.830
Heck yeah!

15:41.830 --> 15:43.520
Oh, no... Oh, no...

15:43.520 --> 15:45.340
At this rate, he's...

15:45.340 --> 15:47.710
Mister Nacht is gonna...

15:48.900 --> 15:51.970
All right! Time to head 
to the Spade Kingdom!

15:52.510 --> 15:56.720
That said, it'll probably take 
forever even with Devil Union.

15:56.720 --> 16:01.480
I can't do ultra-long-distance 
teleportation without Mister Nacht around.

16:01.480 --> 16:05.480
And right now, he wouldn't 
be able to do that anyway.

16:06.570 --> 16:07.860
What do we do, then?

16:08.780 --> 16:09.510
Huh?

16:11.870 --> 16:15.680
It came undone way faster 
than I thought it would!

16:13.440 --> 16:15.680
You idiot! Hurry up and 
use Demon Slayer to fly!

16:20.800 --> 16:22.160
Ow...

16:22.160 --> 16:24.810
There you go, getting 
insanely strong again.

16:25.430 --> 16:29.850
But isn't it pretty cold to 
try to head over on your own?

16:30.720 --> 16:31.540
Got it!

16:42.930 --> 16:45.600
Protect everyone!

16:45.600 --> 16:49.670
On the pride of the Mage Defense Force!

17:01.880 --> 17:03.500
Over here! Over here!

17:05.950 --> 17:07.000
Where are we?

17:07.300 --> 17:11.120
Snow Creation Magic: Snowman Safehouse.

17:12.250 --> 17:15.510
You're okay now. You'll be safe in here!

17:15.750 --> 17:17.210
Please! Come in!

17:17.210 --> 17:19.350
Th-Thank you very much.

17:22.710 --> 17:26.270
<i>I'll use my snow magic to hide 
the citizens from the devils,</i>

17:26.270 --> 17:28.860
<i>and Valtos will use his 
magic to let them escape.</i>

17:28.860 --> 17:31.770
Bah-ha! In the unlikely 
event that they find us,

17:31.770 --> 17:33.990
I'll use my magic to blow them away!

17:33.990 --> 17:37.360
<i>Do not find us! Absolutely 
do not find us! Bah-ha!</i>

17:41.700 --> 17:45.960
Damn it! Not only are they strong, 
but there are too many of them!

18:00.410 --> 18:01.990
Though we're from a different kingdom,

18:01.990 --> 18:05.100
we want to protect our 
people just the same.

18:05.100 --> 18:08.350
The fire spirit! How sublime!

18:20.900 --> 18:22.870
Crap! They found us!

18:35.670 --> 18:36.800
Damn it!

18:46.520 --> 18:47.270
Wha—

18:47.270 --> 18:48.060
Bah-ha?!

18:48.660 --> 18:51.440
<i>What was that powerful magic just now?!</i>

18:51.790 --> 18:55.690
<i>It didn't hit any of us humans,
but only attacked the devils?</i>

18:56.290 --> 18:57.820
Glad to have you!

18:59.020 --> 19:02.680
We won't let you devils have 
your way with this world!

19:07.330 --> 19:08.990
Welcome, welcome!

19:08.990 --> 19:11.770
Hello there! I'm Dryad!

19:11.770 --> 19:13.330
I knew you'd come!

19:13.330 --> 19:15.970
At this rate, there'll be 
lots of devils showing up,

19:15.970 --> 19:19.220
and Elysia will be in trouble, too,

19:19.220 --> 19:21.610
so I'll help you guys out.

19:21.610 --> 19:23.720
<i>She's not what I'd imagined...</i>

19:23.970 --> 19:26.840
We're going to teach you 
the ultimate magic.

19:27.210 --> 19:30.110
It embodies all the magic of its caster,

19:30.450 --> 19:32.510
making it a unique, unrivaled 
spell for each person.

19:32.510 --> 19:34.230
It's the essence of magic.

19:34.890 --> 19:39.400
Normally, only chosen elves who 
have colossal magic can use it.

19:39.400 --> 19:41.870
Humans have far too little magic.

19:42.470 --> 19:44.450
But, but, but...

19:44.450 --> 19:48.980
By making use of the Mana 
Method in the Heart Kingdom,

19:48.980 --> 19:53.680
you acquired True Magic that uses 
a massive amount of natural mana!

19:54.860 --> 19:58.960
<i>The six months we spent training in 
the Heart Kingdom weren't in vain!</i>

19:58.960 --> 20:02.840
<i>In Elysia, we became acquainted 
with the origin of souls...</i>

20:02.840 --> 20:05.340
<i>...and with the superhuman 
power of True Magic...</i>

20:05.340 --> 20:08.220
<i>...that also draws mana 
closer physically...</i>

20:08.450 --> 20:10.730
<i>We acquired ultimate magic!</i>

20:10.730 --> 20:11.980
<i>True Water...</i>

20:11.980 --> 20:13.230
<i>True Lightning...</i>

20:13.230 --> 20:14.230
<i>True Earth...</i>

20:14.230 --> 20:15.230
<i>True Cotton...</i>

20:15.230 --> 20:16.730
<i>True Plant...</i>

20:16.730 --> 20:17.980
<i>True Wind...</i>

20:17.980 --> 20:19.230
<i>True Flame...</i>

20:19.560 --> 20:20.570
<i>...Magic!</i>

20:36.740 --> 20:38.250
Holy cow!

20:38.700 --> 20:43.130
They're using those arrays so their 
spells won't hit their allies!

20:43.130 --> 20:44.910
I wonder what happened!

20:44.910 --> 20:46.650
How do those work?

20:46.650 --> 20:49.910
I wonder if they'll let 
me research them later!

20:49.910 --> 20:52.140
Just you wait, Vanica!

20:57.430 --> 21:01.750
You low-ranking imbeciles scrambling 
over each other to get out first...

21:01.750 --> 21:04.630
What exactly are you so afraid of?

21:07.180 --> 21:08.730
Let's play catch!

21:08.730 --> 21:10.410
You're the ball!

21:10.650 --> 21:12.060
They're...

21:12.060 --> 21:13.040
Yes.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.840
Mid-ranking devils!

21:14.840 --> 21:19.920
Nothing beats playing catch while sucking 
in all the tasty mana from outside.

21:19.920 --> 21:25.050
But I bet it's even more 
fun playing with humans.

21:26.990 --> 21:29.610
Now, let's play, humans.

21:29.610 --> 21:32.390
Entertain us with your screams.

21:36.960 --> 21:41.320
Hey, I guess I found 
some perfect playmates.

21:41.320 --> 21:45.170
Let's see how much my 
ultimate magic can do...

21:45.860 --> 21:49.260
by playing with those guys!

21:58.090 --> 21:58.960
Huh?

22:01.130 --> 22:04.420
What's with this guy? When did he...

22:04.420 --> 22:10.260
<i>Ultimate Lightning Magic: 
Lightning Battle Fiend.</i>

22:11.010 --> 22:12.260
Huh?

22:13.240 --> 22:14.910
Aw, man...

22:14.910 --> 22:18.470
How are we supposed to play 
if you can't even see me?
